{"step_index":81,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-01T17:16:51Z","content":"Report is ready. Here's the quick summary:\n\n### @cosmic_explainer — Key Numbers\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| **RPM** | **\\$5.17** (3rd highest of all channels!) |\n| **Lifetime Earnings** | **~\\$13,524** from just **19 videos** in **2.4 years** |\n| **Revenue/Video** | **\\$712** |\n| **Current Monthly** | **\\$28** 💀 (stopped uploading ~2 years ago) |\n| **Tier 1 Traffic** | **79.5%** |\n| **Audience** | 74.4% are 55+, 48% are 65+ (oldest audience ever) |\n\n### 🎯 The Big Takeaway\n\nThis is a **dead goldmine**. The creator made \\$13.5K from 19 MS Paint icon-grid videos and then vanished. The format is **basically the history version of Byte Sized Explainer** — same icon-grid thumbnails, same \"Every ___ Explained\" titles, but for history topics.\n\n**History pays \\$5.17 RPM** (almost as good as tech's \\$5.80) with way less competition. If someone replicated this and actually kept uploading, it could easily reach \\$5K-8K/month. Difficulty: **⭐⭐ EASY** — MS Paint circles + TTS + history research."}
