{"step_index":98,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-01T18:01:50Z","content":"Report is ready. Here's the quick summary:\n\n### @FactTechz — Key Numbers\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| **Monthly Revenue** | **\\$389,785/month** 🤯 |\n| **Annual Rate** | **\\$4.68 MILLION/year** |\n| **Lifetime Earnings** | **~\\$15-25 MILLION** (10 years) |\n| **RPM (Long)** | **\\$4.31** |\n| **Monthly Views** | **287M** (92M long + 195M Shorts) |\n| **Tier 1 Traffic** | **77.8%** (45.8% US!) |\n\n### 🔑 Three Biggest Takeaways:\n\n1. **\\$389K/month from Hindi content** — proves Hindi can earn at Western RPMs if 45.8% of your audience is NRIs in America/UK/Canada\n\n2. **Shorts are a trap**: 194.8M Shorts views earn \\$3,702 (0.9% of revenue). 92.2M long-form views earn \\$408,009 (99.1%). Shorts bring 2x more views but 110x less money.\n\n3. **Not replicable quickly** — this took 10 years, 2,500 videos, a recognizable face, and a loyal diaspora audience. This is an empire, not a side hustle."}
